  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to Engagement with Stakeholders alongside EU-AU High Level Institutional Events</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;The overall objective of this assignment is to support the &lt;strong&gt;implementation of the Joint Vision for 2030, &lt;/strong&gt;notably on the active inclusion of civil society, youth and other key stakeholders in the renewed Africa-Europe Partnership. &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;The specific objective is to assist in the organisation and holding of events and meetings for CSOs, Young people and other stakeholders contributing to the Africa-Europe Partnership.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;Firstly, the contractor shall be requested to support the organisation of an event in the margins of the AU-EU Summit in Luanda, Angola end of November 2025, the CSO-Youth Forum. There will be an estimated &lt;strong&gt;100 Civil Society and Youth Representatives travelling from EU and AU member states to Luanda, Angola. &lt;/strong&gt;Other high-level participants (from the EU, AU and respective member states) are also expected to attend. The estimated duration of the event is &lt;strong&gt;2 day and 2 nights for the 100 participants&lt;/strong&gt; for the event. The exact programme is under development and will be confirmed by the contracting authority. &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
